1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
One dumpling, 18 folds, hidden hot soup.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,300
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,900
Meet China's soup dumpling — xiaolongbao.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,300
The soup isn't poured in.

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,300
It's set as a jelly, then melts as it steams.

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,200
The gold-standard wrapper has exactly 18 folds.

7
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,600
Double-tap if you'd bite one right now.

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,200
It was refined in Nanxiang, Shanghai, in the 1870s.

9
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,600
★ Expert Tip: Nip a small hole, sip the soup first — it comes out scalding.

10
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,600
Do you sip the soup first — or bite straight in?
